# Close delivery — Jira

When `JIRA_TASKS=ON` and card KEY is known:

1. Verify validation lane report APROVADO
2. Comment on card:
   - Summary (plain language)
   - Technical: files, contracts changed
   - Verification: commands + lane report path
   - Documentation: updated or N/A
3. Transition to PR Review when workflow allows
4. If MCP unavailable: note MCP_PENDING; update next_actions.md; inform user

Link report: `docs/workflow/reports/<date>-<slug>.md`
